    "description": "KITE & YOGA It’s sooo goood 🧘🏄\nWe love combining those two activities here WHY ↚ Check out our NEWS section in our BIO ↛ 🌴 https://freeridetarifa.com/kitesurfing-and-yoga-the-benefits/\n\n➳ 𝗕𝗮𝗹𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 & Stability • Yoga strengthens your core and improves balance - it also really helps in finding better stability which translates seamlessly on the board.\n\n➳ 𝗠𝗶𝗻𝗱𝗳𝘂𝗹𝗻𝗲𝘀𝘀 • Both activities promote mindfulness - starting with a morning yoga flow will help you stay calm and present in the water. When kitesurfing you will only focus on your practice.\n\n➳ 𝗙𝗹𝗲𝘅𝗶𝗯𝗶𝗹𝗶𝘁𝘆 • Putting the board, doing manoeuvres on a board and rotating... will get easier. Stretching the body with Yoga practice, kitesurfers use the self capacity of its body to rebalance and therefore to avoid creating compensation the more you practice flexibility with yoga.\n\n➳ Avoid Injuries • Yoga helps to strengthen all your muscles that support the main ones - and so, it will protect your knees, uncles... of any lesion.\n\n➳ 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝗻𝗲𝗰𝘁 𝘁𝗼 𝗻𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 • Both activities foster a deep connection with nature - making you more attuned to the ocean’s rhythms and the beauty of your surroundings.\n\n➳ 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗺𝘂𝗻𝗶𝘁𝘆 • Kite & Yoga often come with meeting like-minded individuals who share your passion for adventure and self-discovery.\n\nWant to experience the magic of combining KITE & YOGA? ↚ Link in bio ↛ #kiteandyogacamp",
